  "id": "phenomenal-space",
  "term": "phenomenal space",
  "definition": "Phenomenal space is the seemingly objective, observer-independent spatial framework in conscious experience within which events and objects are experienced as located. In the source packet, it refers to the spatial aspect of the world as it appears in awareness, extending around the person as part of conscious perception.",
